                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>1938</cell>
                        <cell role="num">16,480,814</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p rendition="#flush">The foregoing figures indicate that total revenue during the
                    first ten months of the current fiscal year has been the highest for three years
                    and above the average of the past four years.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">(2). <hi rendition="#italic">Financial Resources of the
                        Government</hi></p>
